Description: Finish capture state before delivering its completion
 The completion callback may submit another capture on the same controller.
 Clear the in-flight flag under its mutex before success and failure notifications.
 Keep the new request in flight; cover both paths with synchronous callback submission.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos
Forwarded: no, to be offered to DisplayXR after their open pull request settles
Last-Update: 2026-11-20

